# Payload writes these, drizzle-kit writes the SQL inside them, and nothing here
# is typed by hand. Two consequences worth spelling out:
#
#   -whitespace          the generated SQL indents with a space followed by a
#                        tab, which `git diff --check` reports on every one of
#                        four and a half thousand lines. Whitespace inside a SQL
#                        string is not significant and the file must not be
#                        reformatted — it is regenerated, and a diff against a
#                        hand-tidied copy would be unreadable.
#   linguist-generated   collapses them by default in pull request diffs, so a
#                        schema change shows up as the change rather than as
#                        four thousand lines of CREATE TABLE.
src/migrations/*.ts     -whitespace linguist-generated=true
src/migrations/*.json   -whitespace linguist-generated=true

# Generated from the schema by `npm run generate:types`, same reasoning.
src/payload-types.ts    linguist-generated=true

# Lock files are resolver output. Never merged by hand; regenerated instead.
package-lock.json       -diff linguist-generated=true
